## Wiring at runtime

SSO resolution dispatches on `storepb.IdentityProvider_OAUTH2` and constructs the OAuth2 provider:

```119:134:/bench/repo/server/router/api/v1/auth_service_sso.go
	var userInfo *idp.IdentityProviderUserInfo
	if identityProvider.Type == storepb.IdentityProvider_OAUTH2 {
		oauth2IdentityProvider, err := oauth2.NewIdentityProvider(identityProvider.Config.GetOauth2Config())
		if err != nil {
			return nil, nil, status.Errorf(codes.Internal, "failed to create oauth2 identity provider, error: %v", err)
		}
		// Pass code_verifier for PKCE support (empty string if not provided for backward compatibility)
		token, err := oauth2IdentityProvider.ExchangeToken(ctx, redirectURI, code, codeVerifier)
		if err != nil {
			return nil, nil, status.Errorf(codes.Internal, "failed to exchange token, error: %v", err)
		}
		userInfo, err = oauth2IdentityProvider.UserInfo(ctx, token)
		if err != nil {
			return nil, nil, status.Errorf(codes.Internal, "failed to get user info, error: %v", err)
		}
	}
```

---

## Summary

| Role | Go import path | Key file |
|---|---|---|
| Shared abstraction (user-info struct) | `github.com/usememos/memos/internal/idp` | `/bench/repo/internal/idp/idp.go` |
| Type/config abstraction (proto) | `github.com/usememos/memos/proto/gen/store` | `/bench/repo/proto/store/idp.proto` |
| Concrete OAuth2 implementation | `github.com/usememos/memos/internal/idp/oauth2` | `/bench/repo/internal/idp/oauth2/oauth2.go` |

**Evidence:** The abstraction is `IdentityProviderUserInfo` in `internal/idp`; the only shipped protocol implementation is OAuth2 in `internal/idp/oauth2`, which implements `ExchangeToken` and `UserInfo` and returns `*idp.IdentityProviderUserInfo`. The API/store protos expose only `OAUTH2` as a provider type (lines 11–14 of `idp.proto`, lines 76–79 of `idp_service.proto`).

