    title: ""
    version: 0.0.1
paths:
    /api/v1/ai:transcribe:
```

Embedded for MCP consumption:

```1:10:/bench/repo/proto/openapi_embed.go
package proto

import _ "embed"

//go:embed gen/openapi.yaml
